    <string name="consent_body_send">To turn a link or photo into a recipe, Recipes sends it to our server on Cloudflare.</string>
    <string name="consent_body_kinds">A link: our server loads the page. A photo: your phone reads the text and sends only the text. The photo itself is sent only when your phone cannot read it, for example handwriting.</string>
